			],
			"Message": "feat(Project): Update Cocoon and Sky submodules with interface and telemetry\n\nCoordinate submodule updates across two components:\n\n- Cocoon: Add IFileSystemService interface export in Source/Interfaces/IFileSystemService.ts, providing a clean interface module location for file system operations.\n\n- Sky: Refactor PostHog telemetry with per-component buffering and $component taxonomy. Adds ComponentMap for semantic routing, per-component Buffers Map for independent 2s flush, chunking to 10 marks per request, and $component property on all capture events.\n\nThis enables component-filtered PostHog queries (e.g., \"land:wind:marks\") for debugging cross-component issues during editor bootstrap.",
